                                        <h3>What is Swiggy's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Operational excellence + delivery infrastructure + Instamart quick commerce + multi-line portfolio. Category-defining Indian delivery infrastructure.</p>
                                        <h3>Swiggy or Zomato — which is better?</h3>
